    "helpTipsScannerTitle": "Barcode scanners",
    "helpTipsScannerBody": "A handheld USB or Bluetooth scanner types the barcode and presses Enter for you. Click into the barcode or search field first, then scan — there is nothing to pair or install in the app.",
    "helpTipsOfflineTitle": "It works offline",
    "helpTipsOfflineBody": "There is no server and no cloud account. The catalogue is a database file on this device, so the desk keeps working when the internet does not.",
